PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ALSC"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-ALSC"
Product Description: "A BACnet/IP advanced life safety controller built on the CAS BACnet Stack. A smoke detector (simulated - the example's only input from the physical world) is Life Safety Point 1; its zone is Life Safety Zone 1. The device latches the detector's alarm, sends CHANGE_OF_LIFE_SAFETY event notifications to the recipients in a writable recipient list, logs every notification in Event Log 1, and executes LifeSafetyOperation (silence / unsilence / reset), AcknowledgeAlarm and GetEventInformation. Schedule 1 drives Analog Output 1 by date and time from the device clock, which TimeSynchronization sets. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-ALSC profile."

